Package: qtzalo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libasound2 | libasound2t64, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libgl1
Recommends: ffmpeg, zenity, xclip, wl-clipboard, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk
Maintainer: quangthoai1985 <quangthoai1985@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/quangthoai1985/QTzalo
Description: Native Zalo desktop client written in Rust (unofficial)
 QTzalo is a lightweight, unofficial Zalo desktop client built with Rust
 (eframe/egui + ratatui). Fork of ctdozlite by ctdoteam1110.
 User data is stored in ~/.local/share/qtzalo.
